. Also koala is located at 5 Shannon Rise Banksia Park. I'm completing this on behalf of my parents and can't manually enter their location"}],["1655966321",138.73563,-34.82543,15676,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-12-02",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"2b435887-b9d1-430b-8b67-5a33f33e9369","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:88385","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966321","behavior":"Eating"}],["1655966528",138.74874,-34.83215,15703,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-12-29",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"d348a427-b190-4452-a2de-f652a353228d","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:88939","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966528","sex":"Male","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"This the same koala I have previously mentioned. Old male, with very little fur on its ears and a smooth chest, fur worn away."}],["1632963093",138.70827,-34.82667,17132,20,2,1,50,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2016-11-27T21:20",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"84a649ce-ff81-420d-9c41-aa1de59e3766","occurrenceId":"969cb110-20d9-41e8-8cd1-4f28b016fdfe","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1632963093","locality":"2A Whiting Rd, St Agnes SA 5097, Australia","notes":"Large, loud koala","recordStatus":"confident"}],["2611964359",138.74499,-34.82774,18348,20,40,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2020-03-27T11:40Z",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"e3ce628e-9683-4af7-b7a9-47eef785d3bb","occurrenceId":"1adc3dd1-79e4-4d99-8eff-4f1d465bb3e5","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/2611964359","recordStatus":"<a href='https://bee.questagame.com/#/expert/pastwork/341138/comments?search=true&sighting_source_id=341138&_k=1vxxpo'>Challenge ID?</a>","photos":[{"url":"https://images.ala.org.au/image/proxyImageThumbnailLarge?imageId=d4ec7f25-2e33-409e-bf2d